              </p>

              <h3>
                Boston Green Wine Glass
              </h3>

              <p class="journal-story-product-brand">
                Villeroy & Boch
              </p>

              <a
                href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
                class="journal-story-discover"
              >
                Discover →
              </a>

            </div>

          </article>


          <article class="journal-look-card">

            <a
              href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
              class="journal-look-image"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue floral dessert plates by fanquare"
              />
            </a>

            <div class="journal-look-info">

              <p class="journal-story-product-category">
                TABLEWARE
              </p>

              <h3>
                Blue Floral Dessert Plates
              </h3>

              <p class="journal-story-product-brand">
                fanquare
              </p>

              <a
                href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
                class="journal-story-discover"
              >
                Discover →
              </a>

            </div>

          </article>


          <article class="journal-look-card">

            <a
              href="/kasodi-edit/botanical-vintage-pitcher"
              class="journal-look-image"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-floral-ceramic-pitcher.png"
                alt="Botanical vintage pitcher by Ethereal Eves"
              />
            </a>

            <div class="journal-look-info">

              <p class="journal-story-product-category">
                HOME DECOR
              </p>

              <h3>
                Botanical Vintage Pitcher
              </h3>

              <p class="journal-story-product-brand">
                Ethereal Eves
              </p>

              <a
                href="/kasodi-edit/botanical-vintage-pitcher"
                class="journal-story-discover"
              >
                Discover →
              </a>

            </div>

          </article>


        </div>

      </section>


      <!-- FINAL -->

      <section class="journal-article-final">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          THE KASODI APPROACH
        </p>

        <h2>
          Create a table that feels collected,
          not decorated.
        </h2>

        <p>
          Choose fewer pieces, notice texture and colour, and allow
          the setting to feel personal rather than perfectly coordinated.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>

    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>